    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29041" root="عس" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُسُسٌ</span></b>  <i>Slowness,</i> or <i>tardiness.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also,
[in the CK, erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُسْعُس</span>,] <i>Covetous merchants</i> or <i>traders:</i> (IAar, O, K, * TA:) accord.
to [some of] the copies of the K, it signifies
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُجَّارٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُرَصَآءُ</span>; but the conjunction should be
omitted. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  And <i>Large vessels.</i> (IAar,
O, K.)

